      "updated": 1795253531629,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A match is due when it has kicked off, is not over, and is a\nfavorite or followed. Playing, or not started less than 90 min late,\nor at halftime for 14 min or more (halftime is not polled)\nAllowed when quota is left and 5 min have passed since the last poll\nFrom 70 of 100 requests used: 10 min apart, favorites only\nNothing due, or too soon: steps 3 and 4 are skipped",
      "originalText": "A match is due when it has kicked off, is not over, and is a\nfavorite or followed. Playing, or not started less than 90 min late,\nor at halftime for 14 min or more (halftime is not polled)\nAllowed when quota is left and 5 min have passed since the last poll\nFrom 70 of 100 requests used: 10 min apart, favorites only\nNothing due, or too soon: steps 3 and 4 are skipped",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
