      "updated": 1795253531629,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "fixtures?live=39-140-... covers the leagues of every due match\nSent through the relay on Vercel, at a settled second of the minute\nRefused for rate limit: waits 20 s and tries once more\nStill refused: nothing is recorded, the extras are skipped,\nand the next beat asks again",
      "originalText": "fixtures?live=39-140-... covers the leagues of every due match\nSent through the relay on Vercel, at a settled second of the minute\nRefused for rate limit: waits 20 s and tries once more\nStill refused: nothing is recorded, the extras are skipped,\nand the next beat asks again",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
