      "updated": 1795253531629,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Link fixtures with no API-Football id from this answer (no extra request)\nInsert new events. The first poll of a match is backfill, later ones are news\nUpdate status and score. Kickoff and full time owe an alert\nSeen live, then missing 100 min after kickoff: the match is over\nA goal missing from 2 polls in a row, or cancelled by VAR, is removed\nCount the request in poll_state",
      "originalText": "Link fixtures with no API-Football id from this answer (no extra request)\nInsert new events. The first poll of a match is backfill, later ones are news\nUpdate status and score. Kickoff and full time owe an alert\nSeen live, then missing 100 min after kickoff: the match is over\nA goal missing from 2 polls in a row, or cancelled by VAR, is removed\nCount the request in poll_state",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
