      "updated": 1795253531629,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Skipped if step 3 was refused for rate limit\nLook up the id of a tracked match by date, 70 min before kickoff\nLineups at 60, 45, 30 and 10 min before kickoff, at least 14 min apart\nHalftime statistics, final statistics, one fetch by id after the match\nEach kind is capped at 3 per run. An empty answer still costs a try",
      "originalText": "Skipped if step 3 was refused for rate limit\nLook up the id of a tracked match by date, 70 min before kickoff\nLineups at 60, 45, 30 and 10 min before kickoff, at least 14 min apart\nHalftime statistics, final statistics, one fetch by id after the match\nEach kind is capped at 3 per run. An empty answer still costs a try",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
